Regarding her epilepsy, she reports that she has not had a seizure in the past year. She is currently taking Keppra. She reports that she is doing well with therapy, but she still feels a little down and stressed. She denies any feelings of wanting to hurt herself or anybody else.

Regarding her peptic ulcer disease, she reports that she has been doing well since her endoscopy. She denies any abdominal pain, nausea, or vomiting.

REVIEW OF SYSTEMS

• Constitutional: Denies fever or chills.
• Ears, Nose, Mouth and Throat: Endorses nasal congestion from allergies.
• Cardiovascular: Denies chest pain or dyspnea.
