Endoscopy showed gastritis.

ASSESSMENT AND PLAN

Anna Rodriguez is a 26-year-old female with a past medical history significant for epilepsy, depression, and peptic ulcer disease, who presents with left elbow pain.

Olecranon Bursitis.
